	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Gratissimae mihi fuerunt literę tuę, ornatissime <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ex illis non minus quam ex aliis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>omnibus plane intelligo voluntatem tibi amicitię <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nostrę non augendę tantum, sed etiam in omne aevum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>propagandę; id ut fiat, quantum in me est omnem navaro <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>operam.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Hoc unum mihi grave est, quod non datur facultas <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>aliquo modo recompensandorum beneficiorum.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Tam enim <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>saepius me acceptissimis tuis foetibus honorasti, et quod s<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>cribam preter de te merendi voluntatem et studium <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>habeo nihil, daturus tamen strenuam operam, ut aliquando <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>erga te gratus adpaream.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Que de concordia <placeName ref="l862">Helvetica</placeName> scribis, mihi <persName>Hylaeo</persName> melle <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>sunt gratiora; scio enim, quantum sibi <placeName ref="l822">Germanię</placeName> hostes <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>et ipsi quidem pseudogermani lucri ex vestra discordia <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>accessurum polliceantur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Idem dico de <placeName ref="l167">Genevensium</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>amicitia, quam dominus confirmet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/><persName>Thrasonicus ille Bolvilerus</persName> dignus est hoc argumento: <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>turbatores tales sunt multi.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Philippi nostri animum dudum novi; vix dici potest, quam <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>inique tractetur ab iis, quibus multa contulit beneficia; <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>multos certe aluit actenus catulos.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/><placeName ref="l619">Bavarię</placeName> dux comitia celebrabat <placeName ref="l276">Landshutę</placeName> admo<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>dum infoeliciter ineunda.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Parasceuen, quam vides, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName>Faber</persName> noster ludere voluit.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Nobiles ambiunt <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>evangelium ardentissimis votis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Electores <placeName ref="l513">Ulmę</placeName> convenient; ad eos etiam venturus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>est rex <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandus</persName> statim post festa natalicia.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Multa essent ad te scribenda; sed non licuit, ia<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>m scripturus propediem, quę de istis conventibus sint <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>speranda.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, et <persName>Geryonem</persName> tuu<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>m ama.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Filius probe suo fungitur munere; <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>sentiet quotidie magis meam in se dexteritatem.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/><placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName> ocyssime 26. novembris anno etc. 57.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p2856">G(eryon)</persName> t(uus).</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ornatissimo atque doctissimo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>d. et fratri colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tyguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
